flowchart TD
    A[GeminiProvider] --> B{Determine Input Type}
    
    B -->|Native PDF / OCR Text| C[Structured Text Extraction]
    B -->|Scanned Image| D[VLM Image Extraction]
    
    C --> E[google-genai SDK API]
    D --> E
    
    E -->|Call Gemini API with Pydantic Schema| F{API Response}
    
    F -->|Success| G[Parse JSON to Pydantic Model]
    F -->|RateLimit / Network Error| H[Retry Loop]
    H --> E
    H -->|Max Retries| I[Extraction Exception]
    
    F -->|Invalid Schema / Bad Request| J[Extraction Exception]
    
    G --> K[Return BaseExtractionSchema]
    
    I & J --> L{Fallback Enabled?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Invoke RuleBasedExtractor]
    L -->|No| N[Mark Job FAILED]
